        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Definition: Central concept in Unit 7: Environmental Chemistry II: Water.\n2. Governing Mechanism: Rigorous study of Unit 7: Environmental Chemistry II: Water with 12% weightage. Reversible reactions, Le Chatelier principle, functional groups, and chemical industries per BISE Swat specifications....\n3. Mathematical / Structural Model: Kc = [Products] / [Reactants] (Law of mass action expression.)\n4. Practical Application: Widely utilized in experimental setups and modern scientific technology across Pakistan.",
