        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Definition: Governing algebraic or geometric rule in Unit 8: Projection of a Side of a Triangle.\n2. Governing Mechanism: Mathematical study of Unit 8: Projection of a Side of a Triangle carrying 8.42% weightage in BISE Swat matric mathematics. Quadratic formulas, circle theorems, and trigonometry proofs....\n3. Mathematical / Structural Model: x = (-b ± √(b² - 4ac)) / (2a) (Standard quadratic formula for roots.)\n4. Practical Application: Widely utilized in experimental setups and modern scientific technology across Pakistan.",
        "modelAnswerUr": "1. تعریف: Governing algebraic or geometric rule in Unit 8: Projection of a Side of a Triangle.\n2. سائنسی طریقہ کار: کے پی ٹیکسٹ بک بورڈ کے اصول کے مطابق عمل درآمد۔\n3. کلیہ یا ساخت: متعلقہ سائنسی مساوات اور خاکہ۔\n4. عملی اطلاق: روزمرہ زندگی اور سائنسی تجربات میں اہم کردار۔",
        "boardTipEn": "In BISE Swat exams, write 4 distinct points to secure 4/4 marks in Section B.",
