        "modelAnswerUr": "1. عام غلطی: Confusing lytic cycle with lysogenic cycle in viral reproduction.\n2. درست تصور: Lytic causes host cell burst; lysogenic integrates viral genome into host chromosome without immediate lysis.\n3. سائنسی دلیل: Examiners deduct full marks for cycle confusion.",
