        "questionUr": "باب 6: پروکیریوٹس (بیکٹیریا) میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Confusing lytic cycle with lysogenic cycle in viral reproduction.\n2. Correct Fact: Lytic causes host cell burst; lysogenic integrates viral genome into host chromosome without immediate lysis.\n3. Scientific Reason: Examiners deduct full marks for cycle confusion.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
