        "marks": 4,
        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Industrial Chemistry? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "یونٹ 10: صنعتی کیمسٹری (فرٹیلائزرز، سیمنٹ، گلاس) میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Writing single-headed arrows instead of double-headed curved arrows for electron pair movement.\n2. Correct Fact: Curved arrows must always start from the electron pair (lone pair or bond) and point directly to the electrophilic atom.\n3. Scientific Reason: Arrow conventions are strictly penalized if drawn incorrectly.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
