        "marks": 4,
        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Homeostasis? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "باب 2: ہومیوسٹیسس میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Stating that ADH decreases urine concentration.\n2. Correct Fact: ADH increases water reabsorption in collecting ducts, making urine more concentrated and hypertonic.\n3. Scientific Reason: ADH conserves body water during dehydration.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
        "modelAnswerUr": "1. عام غلطی: Stating that ADH decreases urine concentration.\n2. درست تصور: ADH increases water reabsorption in collecting ducts, making urine more concentrated and hypertonic.\n3. سائنسی دلیل: ADH conserves body water during dehydration.",
