        "marks": 4,
        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Chromosomes and DNA? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "باب 10: کروموسومز اور ڈی این اے میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Pairing Adenine with Cytosine in nucleic acid synthesis.\n2. Correct Fact: Adenine pairs with Thymine via 2 hydrogen bonds (A=T); Guanine pairs with Cytosine via 3 hydrogen bonds (G≡C). In RNA, Uracil replaces Thymine.\n3. Scientific Reason: Complementary base pairing is fundamental to replication fidelity.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
        "modelAnswerUr": "1. عام غلطی: Pairing Adenine with Cytosine in nucleic acid synthesis.\n2. درست تصور: Adenine pairs with Thymine via 2 hydrogen bonds (A=T); Guanine pairs with Cytosine via 3 hydrogen bonds (G≡C). In RNA, Uracil replaces Thymine.\n3. سائنسی دلیل: Complementary base pairing is fundamental to replication fidelity.",
