        "marks": 4,
        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Evolution? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "باب 11: ارتقاء میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Confusing homologous organs with analogous organs.\n2. Correct Fact: Homologous structures share common embryonic origin and anatomy (human arm, bat wing); analogous organs share function but differ in origin (bird wing, insect wing).\n3. Scientific Reason: Divergent vs convergent evolution depends on structural origin.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
