        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Biotechnology? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "باب 13: بائیو ٹیکنالوجی میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Confusing PCR stages: denaturation, annealing, and extension.\n2. Correct Fact: Denaturation occurs at 94°C (strands separate); Annealing at 54°C (primers bind); Extension at 72°C (Taq polymerase synthesizes new DNA).\n3. Scientific Reason: Temperature sequencing is required for full 4 marks.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
        "modelAnswerUr": "1. عام غلطی: Confusing PCR stages: denaturation, annealing, and extension.\n2. درست تصور: Denaturation occurs at 94°C (strands separate); Annealing at 54°C (primers bind); Extension at 72°C (Taq polymerase synthesizes new DNA).\n3. سائنسی دلیل: Temperature sequencing is required for full 4 marks.",
