        "marks": 4,
        "questionEn": "What common conceptual error do students make regarding Biology and Human Welfare? State the correct scientific fact with reasoning.",
        "questionUr": "باب 14: بائیولوجی اور انسانی فلاح میں کون سی غلط فہمی پائی جاتی ہے؟ سائنسی دلیل کے ساتھ درست جواب دیں۔",
        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Common Error: Confusing somatic gene therapy with germline gene therapy.\n2. Correct Fact: Somatic gene therapy alters body cells and is not inheritable; germline gene therapy modifies gametes and is passed to future generations.\n3. Scientific Reason: Heritability distinction is an essential examiner test point.\n4. Board Recommendation: Examiners specifically penalize this confusion; ensure you state the proper causal mechanism.",
