        "modelAnswerEn": "1. Definition: Foundational principle in Unit 3: Land of Pakistan (Geography and Climate).\n2. Governing Mechanism: FSc Pakistan Studies curriculum covering Unit 3: Land of Pakistan (Geography and Climate) for BISE Swat. Strategic geography of Pakistan, Indus water treaty, CPEC economic corridor, foreign policy, and administrative governance....\n3. Mathematical / Structural Model: Requires labeled diagrams with correct scientific terminology.\n4. Practical Application: Widely utilized in experimental setups and modern scientific technology across Pakistan.",
        "modelAnswerUr": "1. تعریف: Foundational principle in Unit 3: Land of Pakistan (Geography and Climate).\n2. سائنسی طریقہ کار: کے پی ٹیکسٹ بک بورڈ کے اصول کے مطابق عمل درآمد۔\n3. کلیہ یا ساخت: متعلقہ سائنسی مساوات اور خاکہ۔\n4. عملی اطلاق: روزمرہ زندگی اور سائنسی تجربات میں اہم کردار۔"
